  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Duluth, MN\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Duluth, MN\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nDuluth, MN\nAfter-Hours Emergency\n218.302.8000\n2314 W Michigan St.\nDuluth, MN 55806\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nMon: 12 am-8 am; 4 pm-8 am\nTue-Wed: 4 pm-8 am\nThu 4 pm-Mon 8 am\n*Please call before arriving*\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nDue to an unprecedented volume of patients and recent staffing changes, we have temporarily adjusted our hours of operation while we recruit additional support staff. Our team remains committed to providing exceptional emergency care, but we may occasionally reach capacity based on patient volume and available resources. If that occurs, pet owners may be directed to the nearest BluePearl Pet Hospital. We appreciate your patience and support as we continue serving pets and families throughout our region.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Duluth – serving northern Minnesota.\nWe are located in Duluth, and we serve pets in northern Minnesota, the Arrowhead region and northern Wisconsin.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, your Duluth emergency vet is ready. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nOur Duluth hospital is open after hours and on weekends when your primary care veterinarian may be closed. We’re also open on holidays.\nEmergency\nOur Duluth hospital is open after hours and on weekends when your primary care veterinarian may be closed. We’re also open on holidays.\nSee Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Duluth.\nOur 2,600-square-foot hospital opened in 2006, as Affiliated Emergency Veterinary Service, and serves a broad area in northern Minnesota and Wisconsin.\nWe are equipped with an in-house laboratory, pharmacy, a fully functional surgery suite, an intensive care unit and state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment, such as digital radiography and ultrasound.\nOur hospital also has a\nveterinary blood bank\n.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n218.302.8000\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“Thanks to Dr. Hart and the BluePearl team for taking such good care of her the first night. You made a huge difference.” — Susan L.\nRead more of\nSusan’s story\n.\nCurrent location.\n218.302.8000\n218.302.8004\n2314 W Michigan St.\nDuluth,\nMN                                    55806\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBlaine, MN\n11850 Aberdeen St. NE\nBlaine, MN 55449\n763.754.9434\n121.32 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nArden Hills, MN\n1285 Grey Fox Rd., Ste. 100\nArden Hills, MN 55112\n763.754.5000\n128.01 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSt. Cloud, MN\n4180 Thielman Ln.\nSt. Cloud, MN 56301\n320.258.3481\n130.48 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
